houghtCard": {"reasoningExpanded": false, "reasoningContent": "Let me analyze the data collected:\n\n**Steps (3 days):**\n- 4/25: 6,187 steps (4.03 km)\n- 4/26: 10,864 steps (7.26 km) - highest, due to badminton\n- 4/27: 8,387 steps (5.18 km)\n- Total: 25,439 steps, 16.47 km\n\n**Workout:**\n- 4/26: Badminton, 2h3min, 2.21km, 897.9 kcal, avg HR 137 bpm\n\n**Sleep:**\n- 4/25: 250 min (4h10min) - Deep 28min, Core 153min, REM 69min, Awake 8min - VERY SHORT\n- 4/26: 432 min (7h12min) - Deep 39min, Core 242min, REM 84min, Awake 49min - Better but still some awake time\n- 4/27: No sleep data shown (maybe not yet recorded)\n\n**Energy:**\n- 4/25: Rest 1,685.6 kcal, Active 213.3 kcal, Total 1,898.9 kcal\n- 4/26: Rest 1,728.3 kcal, Active 1,138.0 kcal, Total 2,866.3 kcal - very high due to badminton\n- 4/27: Rest 1,723.4 kcal, Active 313.8 kcal, Total 2,037.2 kcal\n\nKey observations:\n1. Sleep on 4/25 was very short (4h10min) - insufficient\n2. Sleep on 4/26 was better (7h12min) but still had 49min awake time\n3. Deep sleep is low on both days (28min and 39min, recommended is 60-90min)\n4. Only 1 workout in 3 days (badminton on 4/26)\n5. Steps are decent but 4/25 was below average\n6. No sleep data for 4/27\n\nNow I need to query tasks first, then generate health tasks.", "reasoningVisibility": "full", "reasoningDurationMs": 58014}}, {"text": "好的！我来执行健康分析任务。首先查询最近三天（4月25日-4月27日）的运动、睡眠、步数和能量数据。", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T00:41:50.627Z", "id": "25FC04DB-D8D0-451C-B88F-D563F1FF7ED3", "kind": "text", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T00:41:49.762Z"}, {"createdAt": "2026-04-29T00:41:50.866Z", "kind": "tool", "toolName": "fetch_workout_details", "id": "AE9590F0-B21E-4C0E-BFA5-C4C1C8F30816", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T00:41:52.555Z", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_d5b6503ca92a477a8a33c769"}, "toolCallID": "call_d5b6503ca92a477a8a33c769", "text": "正在使用工具：运动详情\n运动记录 2026-04-25 - 2026-04-27:\n- 2026年4月26日 18:59: 羽毛球，时长 2小时3分钟，距离 2.21 公里，活动能量 897.9 千卡，平均心率 137 bpm"}, {"createdAt":