康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。", "delivery_state": "pending", "created_at": "2026-04-29T01:13:45.708Z", "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_max_messages": 20, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。", "tombstone": false, "model_name": "glm-5.1", "blocks": [{"id": "284A578C-140A-4025-8E9E-A35339B20527", "kind": "deepThought", "deepThoughtCard": {"reasoningVisibility": "full", "reasoningContent": "Let me analyze the sleep data for the last three days (2026-04-25 to 2026-04-27).\n\nData:\n- 2026-04-25: Total 250 min (Deep 28 min, Core 153 min, REM 69 min, Awake 8 min)\n- 2026-04-26: Total 432 min (Deep 39 min, Core 242 min, REM 84 min, Awake 49 min)\n- 2026-04-27: No data yet (today, might not have slept yet or data not available)\n\nLet me calculate the percentages:\n\n2026-04-25:\n- Deep: 28/250 = 11.2%\n- Core: 153/250 = 61.2%\n- REM: 69/250 = 27.6%\n- Awake: 8/250 = 3.2%\n\n2026-04-26:\n- Deep: 39/432 = 9.0%\n- Core: 242/432 = 56.0%\n- REM: 84/432 = 19.4%\n- Awake: 49/432 = 11.3%\n\nRecommended proportions (general guidelines):\n- Deep sleep: 15-20% of total sleep\n- REM sleep: 20-25% of total sleep\n- Core (light) sleep: 50-60% of total sleep\n\nIssues identified:\n1. 4/25: Total sleep only 250 min (~4.2 hours) - far below the recommended 7-9 hours\n2. 4/26: Total sleep 432 min (~7.2 hours) - within recommended range\n3. Both days have low deep sleep percentage (11.2% and 9.0% vs recommended 15-20%)\n4. 4/26 has high awake time (49 min, 11.3%) suggesting sleep fragmentation\n5. 4/27 no data yet\n\nLet me provide a comprehensive analysis.", "reasoningDurationMs": 23539, "reasoningExpanded": false}, "createdAt": "2026-04-29T01:13:45.708Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T01:13:45.708Z"}], "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "role": "assistant", "client_message_id": "3D0DBDFE-FE9D-4DDC-BFD7-A9CA17A61FEF", "thread_current_model_name": "glm-5.1", "thread_temperature": 0.6}]}
