gContent": "Let me analyze the sleep data for the last three days (2026-04-25 to 2026-04-27).\n\nData:\n- 2026-04-25: Total 250 min (Deep 28 min, Core 153 min, REM 69 min, Awake 8 min)\n- 2026-04-26: Total 432 min (Deep 39 min, Core 242 min, REM 84 min, Awake 49 min)\n- 2026-04-27: No data yet (today, might not have slept yet or data not available)\n\nLet me calculate the percentages:\n\n2026-04-25:\n- Deep: 28/250 = 11.2%\n- Core: 153/250 = 61.2%\n- REM: 69/250 = 27.6%\n- Awake: 8/250 = 3.2%\n\n2026-04-26:\n- Deep: 39/432 = 9.0%\n- Core: 242/432 = 56.0%\n- REM: 84/432 = 19.4%\n- Awake: 49/432 = 11.3%\n\nRecommended proportions (general guidelines):\n- Deep sleep: 15-20% of total sleep\n- REM sleep: 20-25% of total sleep\n- Core (light) sleep: 50-60% of total sleep\n\nIssues identified:\n1. 4/25: Total sleep only 250 min (~4.2 hours) - far below the recommended 7-9 hours\n2. 4/26: Total sleep 432 min (~7.2 hours) - within recommended range\n3. Both days have low deep sleep percentage (11.2% and 9.0% vs recommended 15-20%)\n4. 4/26 has high awake time (49 min, 11.3%) suggesting sleep fragmentation\n5. 4/27 no data yet\n\nLet me provide a comprehensive analysis.", "reasoningVisibility": "full"}, "id": "0DFF27D5-8419-47BD-B8A3-F216CE5F445B", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T01:12:12.406Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T01:13:45.544Z"}, {"updatedAt": "2026-04-29T01:12:15.264Z", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T01:12:14.771Z", "kind": "text", "text": "我来帮你分析最近三天的睡眠情况！先获取睡眠数据。", "id": "65C65AC8-4CCB-4DC0-BC28-9A3201BB085A"}, {"text": "正在使用工具：睡眠详情\n2026-04-25 睡眠时长 250 分钟（深睡 28 分钟，核心 153 分钟，REM 69 分钟，清醒 8 分钟）\n2026-04-26 睡眠时长 432 分钟（深睡 39 分钟，核心 242 分钟，REM 84 分钟，清醒 49 分钟）", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T01:12:15.420Z", "toolCallID": "call_0772716e323a47b285867598", "kind": "tool", "anchor": {"type": "toolCall", "value": "call_0772716e323a47b285867598"}, "id": "2EC9276F-FAB0-4894-9167-7ACA014CF31A", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T01:12:15.302Z", "toolName": "fetch_sleep_details"}, {"sleepVisualization": {"d