 = 56.0%\n- REM: 84/432 = 19.4%\n- Awake: 49/432 = 11.3%\n\nRecommended proportions (general guidelines):\n- Deep sleep: 15-20% of total sleep\n- REM sleep: 20-25% of total sleep\n- Core (light) sleep: 50-60% of total sleep\n\nIssues identified:\n1. 4/25: Total sleep only 250 min (~4.2 hours) - far below the recommended 7-9 hours\n2. 4/26: Total sleep 432 min (~7.2 hours) - within recommended range\n3. Both days have low deep sleep percentage (11.2% and 9.0% vs recommended 15-20%)\n4. 4/26 has high awake time (49 min, 11.3%) suggesting sleep fragmentation\n5. 4/27 no data yet\n\nLet me provide a comprehensive analysis.","reasoningVisibility":"full"},"id":"0DFF27D5-8419-47BD-B8A3-F216CE5F445B","createdAt":"2026-04-29T01:12:12.406Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-29T01:13:45.544Z"},{"updatedAt":"2026-04-29T01:12:15.264Z","createdAt":"2026-04-29T01:12:14.771Z","kind":"text","text":"我来帮你分析最近三天的睡眠情况！先获取睡眠数据。","id":"65C65AC8-4CCB-4DC0-BC28-9A3201BB085A"},{"text":"正在使用工具：睡眠详情\n2026-04-25 睡眠时长 250 分钟（深睡 28 分钟，核心 153 分钟，REM 69 分钟，清醒 8 分钟）\n2026-04-26 睡眠时长 432 分钟（深睡 39 分钟，核心 242 分钟，REM 84 分钟，清醒 49 分钟）","updatedAt":"2026-04-29T01:12:15.420Z","toolCallID":"call_0772716e323a47b285867598","kind":"tool","anchor":{"type":"toolCall","value":"call_0772716e323a47b285867598"},"id":"2EC9276F-FAB0-4894-9167-7ACA014CF31A","createdAt":"2026-04-29T01:12:15.302Z","toolName":"fetch_sleep_details"},{"sleepVisualization":{"days":[{"date":"2026-04-25","summary":{"start":1777145692,"endText":"07:47","end":1777160871,"totalSleepMinutes":250,"startText":"03:34"},"stages":{"awake":8,"unspecified":0,"deep":28,"core":153,"rem":69},"timeline":[{"endText":"03:37","widthPercent":0.9947954410698993,"stage":"core","start":1777145692,"startPercent":0,"startText":"03:34","end":1777145843},{"endText":"03:38","widthPercent":0.39528295671651625,"stage":"awake","start":1777145843,"startPercent":0.9947954410698993,"startText":"03:37","end":1777145903},{"endText":"03:53","widthPercent":5.94900849858357,"stage":"core","start