 - 2026-04-26:\n- 2026年4月26日 18:59: 羽毛球，时长 2小时3分钟，距离 2.21 公里，活动能量 897.9 千卡，平均心率 137 bpm", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T16:13:24.897Z", "toolCallID": "call_uv4631m6p3spaqu3ammjwjz8", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T16:13:29.913Z"}, {"anchor": {"value": "call_53uo054zt81rab820jeby7pj", "type": "toolCall"}, "kind": "tool", "id": "143E9561-1DC2-4EC1-ABB3-5A088F00349B", "toolName": "generate_task", "text": "正在使用工具：生成任务\n{\"queried_first\":true,\"member_id\":28,\"ok\":true,\"extracted\":{\"action\":\"适当增加规律有氧运动,提升每日步数稳定性\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"task_type\":\"exercise\",\"intensity_or_value\":\"8000-10000步\",\"target_metric\":\"步数\",\"time_info\":{\"period\":\"daily\",\"start_time\":\"\",\"frequency\":\"每日\"}},\"similar_tasks\":[{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":31,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:57.087Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":30,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:56.638Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":29,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:56.390Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":28,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:56.218Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":27,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:55.981Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":26,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:55.592Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":25,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:55.343Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":24,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:55.165Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":23,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:54.988Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":22,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:54.527Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":21,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:50:54.341Z\"},{\"status\":0,\"task_id\":19,\"title\":\"步数\",\"type\":1,\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-29T00:46:35.677Z\"}],\"reason\":\"similar_task_exists\",\"action\":\"no_create\"}", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T16:13:33.047Z", "toolCallID": "call_53uo054zt81rab820jeby7pj", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T16:13:39.567Z"}, {"updatedAt": "2026-04-29T16:13:53.091Z", "text": "**健康分析与任务小结**\n\n一、近期步数概况：\n- 2026-04-24：7,354 步 / 4.84 公里\n- 2026-04-25：6,187 步 / 4.03 公里\n- 2026-04-26：10,864 步 / 7.26 公里\n- 总计：24,405 步 / 16.13 公里，日均约 8,135 步，整体活动量呈波动上升趋势，26 日表现尤为突出。\n\n二、建议与任务说明：\n- 运动方面：在 26 日基础上，继续保持每日 8,000~10,000 步的中等强度活动，可通过固定时段快走、骑单车等让运动更规律；\n- 睡眠与综合数据：需补充近 3 天睡眠与运动类型记录，以便更全面地分析睡眠规律及具体运动贡献；\n- 健康任务：查询到已有多个“步数”相关任务正在进行中，暂不重复创建，可先通过现有任务继续维持并巩固运动习惯。\n\n后续待授权补充睡眠与运动类型数据后，可进一步完善分析并制定更个性化的综合健康计划。", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T16:13:42.510Z", "kind": "text", "id": "6671EC37-79EB-4426-B807-4D9C7E3B941D"}], "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_duration_ms": null, "reasoning_expanded": null, "reasoning_visibility": null}]}}
