ool","updatedAt":"2026-04-29T16:31:48.982Z","toolName":"find_member","anchor":{"value":"call_prj8dcdz9sgc2ofwnm16fea5","type":"toolCall"},"toolCallID":"call_prj8dcdz9sgc2ofwnm16fea5"},{"text":"正在使用工具：询问用户\n{\"responses\":[{\"selection_mode\":\"single\",\"question\":\"请选择任务归属成员\",\"selected_options\":[{\"text\":\"纷纷（外婆）\",\"id\":\"q1_option_3\"}],\"question_id\":\"q1\"}]}","id":"7023D921-D053-4374-AFD1-4D686C1E127F","createdAt":"2026-04-29T16:31:52.985Z","kind":"tool","updatedAt":"2026-04-29T16:31:57.077Z","toolName":"ask_user_question","anchor":{"value":"call_capcu6duwnwijorxrcqkkowh","type":"toolCall"},"toolCallID":"call_capcu6duwnwijorxrcqkkowh"},{"text":"正在使用工具：查找成员\n- 纷纷（关系：maternal_grandmother）","id":"AAB1D6D6-7A11-4795-BCD4-8CC072813268","createdAt":"2026-04-29T16:31:59.311Z","kind":"tool","updatedAt":"2026-04-29T16:31:59.972Z","toolName":"find_member","anchor":{"value":"call_42d0380c2rvj3xsx0iwlpkq9","type":"toolCall"},"toolCallID":"call_42d0380c2rvj3xsx0iwlpkq9"},{"text":"正在使用工具：查询成员任务\n{\"ok\":true,\"member_id\":3,\"queried_at\":\"2026-04-29T16:32:07.643Z\",\"total\":0,\"tasks\":[]}","id":"3F73B2E8-E950-4227-BB0D-812466F04C10","createdAt":"2026-04-29T16:32:06.972Z","kind":"tool","updatedAt":"2026-04-29T16:32:07.648Z","toolName":"query_tasks_by_member","anchor":{"value":"call_0bod54l7zqmsn3nme3bul7ey","type":"toolCall"},"toolCallID":"call_0bod54l7zqmsn3nme3bul7ey"},{"id":"42723A95-AB1B-437F-8B93-BD056863DB6C","kind":"text","text":"### 健康分析（基于2026-04-24至2026-04-26数据）\n1. **步数情况**：\n   - 日均步数8135步，其中26日达到10864步为近期最佳，整体活动量呈上升趋势。\n   - 活动高峰集中在上午10-12点及晚间19-22点，建议继续保持该时段活动习惯。\n\n2. **健康建议**：\n   - 可尝试在下午时段（如15-17点）增加轻度活动（如室内散步），进一步提升每日代谢。\n   - 若身体条件允许，每周可增加2-3次20分钟左右的拉伸或平衡练习。\n\n### 生成健康任务\n为外婆“纷纷”定制以下任务（可选3项）：\n- 每日步行8000步（碎片化累计，避免一次性剧烈运动）\n- 晨间拉伸10分钟（唤醒身体，激活关节）\n- 睡前热水泡脚+静心冥想15分钟（提升睡眠质量）\n- 每日记录饮水情况（目标1500ml，分6-8次饮用）\n- 每周3次阳台绿植养护（兼顾轻度活动与心情愉悦）\n\n（注：因睡眠和运动详情未授权，后续任务可根据补充数据动态调整）","createdAt":"2026-04-29T16:32:15.485Z","updatedAt":"2026-04-29T16:32:25.878Z"}]}]}
