01E80DE", "toolCallID": "call_enplysg6fjy7lhqwp9y7wkhx", "toolName": "fetch_workout_details"}, {"kind": "tool", "text": "正在使用工具：询问用户\n【系统】ask_user_question 参数无效：需提供 1-5 个问题，每个问题的 options 必须包含 2-5 个选项。", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T16:46:56.267Z", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T16:46:53.036Z", "anchor": {"value": "call_s2wpqkz0kkqi6darcegbv31p", "type": "toolCall"}, "id": "FAE28393-B31B-4F0A-AC77-0881D4C123F6", "toolCallID": "call_s2wpqkz0kkqi6darcegbv31p", "toolName": "ask_user_question"}, {"kind": "tool", "text": "正在使用工具：询问用户\n{\"responses\":[{\"selected_options\":[{\"text\":\"每晚22:30上床准备睡觉，早上6:30起床\",\"id\":\"q1_option_2\"}],\"question\":\"请选择一个健康任务创建\",\"question_id\":\"q1\",\"selection_mode\":\"single\"}]}", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T16:47:20.734Z", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T16:46:58.100Z", "anchor": {"value": "call_lt15lnm1iznyjwai00ma7bn7", "type": "toolCall"}, "id": "0B7F968D-1DE6-4E64-BAD3-D827BC96F5A7", "toolCallID": "call_lt15lnm1iznyjwai00ma7bn7", "toolName": "ask_user_question"}, {"kind": "text", "createdAt": "2026-04-29T16:47:22.933Z", "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T16:47:28.598Z", "id": "71A10A0D-1F06-41B1-BE5D-5711CC780CDD", "text": "根据您近三天的数据，步数总体达标，且有一次较好的羽毛球运动；但睡眠仅记录到一天且时长不足（建议7-8小时）。您已选择【规律睡眠】任务，现在为您生成：\n\n# 健康任务\n- **标题**：规律睡眠\n- **描述**：目标：改善睡眠时长与质量。动作：每晚22:30上床准备睡觉，早上6:30起床。计划：每天执行。强度：温和，避免睡前看手机。\n- **医学属性**：睡眠习惯/作息调整\n- **提醒时间**：22:00\n- **重复**：每天\n- **优先级**：中\n\n后续会结合您的执行情况逐步调整运动和睡眠方案。"}], "thread_max_tokens": 4096, "server_updated_at": "2026-04-29T16:47:29.142Z", "tombstone": false, "thread_system_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。", "thread_max_messages": 20, "client_message_id": "86B80FAC-BDE7-4D08-B0A2-B500AEC2C784", "thread_current_model_name": "agent-BDF88EAF-6D5E-4308-B7BB-13F1E37C018C", "thread_top_p": 1, "thread_role_prompt": "你是 Spark 健康助手，请优先提供准确、简洁、可执行的健康建议，并使用用户语言回复。", "model_name": "agent-BDF88EAF-6D5E-4308-B7BB-13F1E37C018C", "delivery_state": "pending", "role": "assistant", "created_at": "2026-04-29T16:47:28.632Z", "thread_id": "823608D2-8623-4995-B09B-7A0BD7F7F91B"}]}
